Package: markersync
Title: Sync Zotero PDFs to Markdown via a Marker Server
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Lab", "Member", email = "richard.bluhm@ivr.uni-stuttgart.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for converting Zotero-managed PDFs to Markdown via a
    self-hosted Marker server. Walks a directory of literature notes
    (named by BibTeX citekey), resolves each note's PDF from a Zotero
    select link, sends it to a Marker API endpoint, and saves the
    resulting Markdown plus extracted images alongside.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    curl,
    base64enc,
    tools
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/rbluhm/markersync
BugReports: https://github.com/rbluhm/markersync/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
